# Sites that block automated requests (false positives)
^https?://(www\.)?linkedin\.com
^https?://(www\.)?(twitter|x)\.com
^https?://(www\.)?calendly\.com
^https?://(www\.)?instagram\.com
^https?://(www\.)?facebook\.com
# Placeholder / local URLs
^https?://(localhost|127\.0\.0\.1|example\.com)
# Site API endpoints (not pages)
/api/
